00:30:38.070 --> 00:30:41.060
But there's a full
set of budgeting APIs

00:30:41.060 --> 00:30:46.560
and alert APIs that lets you
set thresholds in your projects.

00:30:46.560 --> 00:30:49.860
And finally, on Thursday,
another customer deep dive,

00:30:49.860 --> 00:30:50.610
Beyond your Bill--

00:30:50.610 --> 00:30:52.460
Getting more Detail into Cost.

00:30:52.460 --> 00:30:56.900
Look at more detail on an actual
customer example of BigQuery,

00:30:56.900 --> 00:31:02.530
Data Studio, and how to slice
and dice with real data.

00:31:02.530 --> 00:31:05.265
These are all linked off
of cloud.google.com/cost

00:31:05.265 --> 00:31:09.240
management, as well.

00:31:09.240 --> 00:31:11.730
And these slides will be
available for your review

00:31:11.730 --> 00:31:12.990
